{"id":"18fe7220421a34b0","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-chowuniq.md","title":"Chow uniqueness theorem","display":"thm-chowuniq — Chow uniqueness theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-chowuniq","aliases":["27-thm-chowuniq"],"display":"thm-chowuniq — Chow uniqueness theorem","depends_on":["[[27-df-threshold]]","[[27-df-chow]]","[[27-thm-threshchar]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§9.6.1 Theorem 9.22","source_printed_pages":"429","source_pdf_pages":"453","verification_status":"source-statement-checked-local-asummability-proof-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-chowuniq"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-chowuniq</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-chowuniq — Chow uniqueness theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d0db491e5f6359f5\" href=\"?note=d0db491e5f6359f5\" title=\"27-df-threshold\">27-df-threshold</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"260aad3bc2408854\" href=\"?note=260aad3bc2408854\" title=\"27-df-chow\">27-df-chow</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ff306e0cc6f0a65e\" href=\"?note=ff306e0cc6f0a65e\" title=\"27-thm-threshchar\">27-thm-threshchar</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§9.6.1 Theorem 9.22"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"429"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"453"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked-local-asummability-proof-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n,\\mathrm{Threshold}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n,\\mathrm{Threshold}_n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Chow}\">\\(\\mathrm{Chow}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d0db491e5f6359f5\" href=\"?note=d0db491e5f6359f5\" title=\"27-df-threshold\">27-df-threshold</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"260aad3bc2408854\" href=\"?note=260aad3bc2408854\" title=\"27-df-chow\">27-df-chow</a>；asummability 表征见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ff306e0cc6f0a65e\" href=\"?note=ff306e0cc6f0a65e\" title=\"27-thm-threshchar\">27-thm-threshchar</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Threshold}_n\\;\\forall g\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Chow}(f)=\\mathrm{Chow}(g)\\longrightarrow f=g\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Threshold}_n\\;\\forall g\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Chow}(f)=\\mathrm{Chow}(g)\\longrightarrow f=g\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>原书 §9.6.1，Theorem 9.22，印刷 p.429／PDF p.453；已核对陈述与该页证明。比较函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 无须是阈值函数，修订扩大为原书的完整结论。</li>\n<li>证明：两函数 Chow 参数相等时，删去共同真点后，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(f)\\setminus T(g)\">\\(T(f)\\setminus T(g)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(g)\\setminus T(f)\">\\(T(g)\\setminus T(f)\\)</span> 大小相等且向量和相等；若非空即违反 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 的 asummability（单点相等则直接违反真、假点互斥）。故两真集相等。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-threshold","status":"resolved","id":"d0db491e5f6359f5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-threshold]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-chow","status":"resolved","id":"260aad3bc2408854","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-chow]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-thm-threshchar","status":"resolved","id":"ff306e0cc6f0a65e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-thm-threshchar]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-threshold","status":"resolved","id":"d0db491e5f6359f5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n,\\mathrm{Threshold}_n$、$\\mathrm{Chow}$ 见 [[27-df-threshold]]、[[27-df-chow]]；asummability 表征见 [[27-thm-threshchar]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-chow","status":"resolved","id":"260aad3bc2408854","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n,\\mathrm{Threshold}_n$、$\\mathrm{Chow}$ 见 [[27-df-threshold]]、[[27-df-chow]]；asummability 表征见 [[27-thm-threshchar]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-thm-threshchar","status":"resolved","id":"ff306e0cc6f0a65e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n,\\mathrm{Threshold}_n$、$\\mathrm{Chow}$ 见 [[27-df-threshold]]、[[27-df-chow]]；asummability 表征见 [[27-thm-threshchar]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n,\\mathrm{Threshold}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Chow}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Threshold}_n\\;\\forall g\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Chow}(f)=\\mathrm{Chow}(g)\\longrightarrow f=g\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"T(f)\\setminus T(g)","display":false},{"tex":"T(g)\\setminus T(f)","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false}],"bytes":1510,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-387","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-chowuniq|thm-chowuniq — Chow uniqueness theorem]]"},{"id":"48ace877e95f08e6","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{WeakAsummable}_n,\\mathrm{ChowFunc}_n$ 见 [[27-df-weakasummable]]，$\\mathrm{Threshold}_n$ 见 [[27-df-threshold]]，阈值唯一性见 [[27-thm-chowuniq]]。"}],"outgoing":["d0db491e5f6359f5","260aad3bc2408854","ff306e0cc6f0a65e"]}